1
00:00:13,582 --> 00:00:16,295
Cold lead and heavy wood,

2
00:00:16,795 --> 00:00:19,710
the bellows heave a sigh.

3
00:00:20,462 --> 00:00:23,222
Melodies forged in dust,

4
00:00:23,307 --> 00:00:26,137
rising to the sky.

5
00:00:26,806 --> 00:00:29,588
The old Vermeulen pipes,

6
00:00:29,887 --> 00:00:32,907
weeping in the dark,

7
00:00:33,615 --> 00:00:36,194
Tearing open heaven

8
00:00:36,528 --> 00:00:39,107
to find a single spark.

9
00:00:39,373 --> 00:00:45,271
And the echo screams  across the hollow years,

10
00:00:46,350 --> 00:00:49,467
A silent tidal wave

11
00:00:49,622 --> 00:00:51,664
of forty years of tears.

12
00:00:51,746 --> 00:00:58,025
I built a fortress out of cold, unyielding stone,

13
00:00:59,327 --> 00:01:02,563
But the echo always finds me,

14
00:01:02,790 --> 00:01:05,930
always claims its own.

15
00:01:06,396 --> 00:01:09,632
Luna’s wild hair tangled in the summer heat.

16
00:01:09,744 --> 00:01:13,027


17
00:01:09,696 --> 00:01:12,739
A tent in Germany, where two heartbeats meet.

18
00:01:13,111 --> 00:01:17,612
Two young lions roaring, wild and unbound,

19
00:01:18,014 --> 00:01:21,476
Before the quiet came, before we hit the ground.

20
00:01:21,666 --> 00:01:25,511
It batters at the walls of who I used to be

21
00:01:25,773 --> 00:01:31,290
Luna, are you still calling out to me?

22
00:01:31,969 --> 00:01:37,509
And the echo screams across the hollow years,

23
00:01:38,894 --> 00:01:41,986
A silent tidal wave

24
00:01:42,249 --> 00:01:45,807
of forty years of tears.

25
00:01:46,142 --> 00:01:48,613
Whispers in the hallway,

26
00:01:48,828 --> 00:01:52,004
rules of kith and kin,

27
00:01:52,504 --> 00:01:55,191
Building up the prison

28
00:01:55,537 --> 00:01:58,546
that we were captured in.

29
00:01:58,761 --> 00:02:01,639
The heavy garage door

30
00:02:01,806 --> 00:02:04,791
slamming on our youth,

31
00:02:05,017 --> 00:02:08,683
The shadow of the Demon

32
00:02:08,826 --> 00:02:10,737
choking out the truth.

33
00:02:10,832 --> 00:02:17,161
I built a fortress out of cold, unyielding stone,

34
00:02:18,211 --> 00:02:21,591
But the echo always finds me,

35
00:02:21,734 --> 00:02:24,038
always claims its own.

36
00:02:24,217 --> 00:02:28,050
It batters at the walls of who I used to be

37
00:02:28,202 --> 00:02:34,519
Luna, are you still calling out to me?

38
00:02:38,708 --> 00:02:41,813
Christmas Eve, the cathedral packed and tight.

39
00:02:41,825 --> 00:02:45,108
I saw you standing there in the freezing light.

40
00:02:45,173 --> 00:02:50,176
The Demon whispered cold: "Sit still, let her depart."

41
00:02:50,868 --> 00:02:53,985
And I froze on the bench,

42
00:02:54,185 --> 00:02:57,026
and I broke my own heart.

43
00:02:57,444 --> 00:03:03,319
And the echo screams across the hollow years,

44
00:03:04,290 --> 00:03:07,574
A silent tidal wave

45
00:03:07,765 --> 00:03:09,974
forty years of tears.

46
00:03:09,986 --> 00:03:16,099
I built a fortress out of cold, unyielding stone,

47
00:03:17,425 --> 00:03:20,780
But the echo always finds me,

48
00:03:20,899 --> 00:03:24,195
always claims its own.

49
00:03:24,238 --> 00:03:30,149
I watched your lips move through the frost and snow,

50
00:03:30,972 --> 00:03:34,172
Words without a sound,

51
00:03:34,507 --> 00:03:37,122
forty years ago.

52
00:03:37,286 --> 00:03:40,355
A plea without a voice,

53
00:03:40,450 --> 00:03:43,399
a cry I couldn't hear,

54
00:03:43,409 --> 00:03:43,517


55
00:03:43,527 --> 00:03:47,419
Vibrating in my chest,

56
00:03:47,567 --> 00:03:49,620
year after year.

57
00:03:49,630 --> 00:03:53,582
It batters at the walls of who I used to be

58
00:03:53,734 --> 00:03:59,561
Luna, are you still calling out to me?

59
00:04:03,074 --> 00:04:09,426
And the echo screams across the hollow years,

60
00:04:09,927 --> 00:04:13,282
A silent tidal wave

61
00:04:13,496 --> 00:04:16,959
of forty years of tears.

62
00:04:17,162 --> 00:04:20,445
Kneeling in the gravel,

63
00:04:20,654 --> 00:04:23,138
on my faded knees,

64
00:04:23,305 --> 00:04:26,660
Touching the smooth white stone

65
00:04:26,780 --> 00:04:29,944
beneath the silent trees.

66
00:04:30,149 --> 00:04:32,597
A heavy golden paw

67
00:04:32,752 --> 00:04:36,084
rests gently on my chest:

68
00:04:36,215 --> 00:04:39,463
"The echo is your fire, Paul,

69
00:04:39,497 --> 00:04:41,706
let the ghosts finally rest."

70
00:04:41,863 --> 00:04:48,955
I built a fortress out of cold, unyielding stone,

71
00:04:49,290 --> 00:04:52,645
But the echo always finds me,

72
00:04:52,862 --> 00:04:55,333
always claims its own.

73
00:04:55,343 --> 00:04:59,176
It batters at the walls of who I used to be

74
00:04:59,499 --> 00:05:06,161
Luna, are you still calling out to me?

75
00:05:09,254 --> 00:05:12,251
The book lies on the table,

76
00:05:12,437 --> 00:05:16,019
the ink is wet and red.

77
00:05:16,356 --> 00:05:18,803
Every single word

78
00:05:18,813 --> 00:05:22,169
is a tear that I have shed.

79
00:05:22,515 --> 00:05:25,440
The cage is blown apart,

80
00:05:25,603 --> 00:05:28,719
the iron doors are torn,

81
00:05:28,887 --> 00:05:32,075
The beast is finally loose,

82
00:05:32,169 --> 00:05:37,446
a quiet fury born. Written in my blood...

83
00:05:37,468 --> 00:05:41,122
The cage is open wide.

84
00:05:41,417 --> 00:05:44,068
No more hiding.

85
00:05:44,161 --> 00:05:48,448
The music swells so high

86
00:05:48,617 --> 00:05:54,623
The echo screams across the hollow years,

87
00:05:55,111 --> 00:06:01,821
And finally we let the ghosts part.

